"No personal identifiable information is collected. <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/FineFindus/Hieroglyphic/blob/main/PRIVACY_POLICY.md\">Privacy "
"policy</a>"
msgstr ""
"Kişisel tanımlanabilir bilgi toplanmamaktadır. <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/FineFindus/Hieroglyphic/blob/main/PRIVACY_POLICY.md\">Gizlilik "
"ilkesi</a>"

